{%- comment -%}
  The Archive (the Record): sold pieces stay live. Proof of demand, and an accumulating SEO asset.
  Beige, like the list band and the footer after it (owner, 2026-11-08): the site stays white and
  beige to the end. It went dark in October and green on 3 Nov; both were taken back.

  A coming-soon or reserved piece may not be available either, but it has not sold: it never
  appears here (D25).

  Three sources, in order: a collection chosen in the editor; on a collection page (the house
  template), the sold pieces of that collection; otherwise everything sold. With nothing sold yet
  the section renders nothing, rather than six empty frames (the frames show in the theme editor).
  View all goes to the whole Archive (the collection archive) once it exists.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if section.settings.collection != blank
    assign recs = collections[section.settings.collection].products
    assign sold_only = false
  elsif template.name == 'collection' and collection
    assign recs = collection.products
    assign sold_only = true
  else
    assign recs = collections.all.products
    assign sold_only = true
  endif
-%}
{%- capture items -%}
  {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
  {%- for p in recs -%}
    {%- if sold_only and p.available -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if p.tags contains 'coming-soon' or p.tags contains 'reserved' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if shown >= 6 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
    <a class="rec" href="{{ p.url }}">
      {%- if p.featured_image -%}{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: p.title, style: 'position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover' }}{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign rec_name = p.vendor | default: p.title | truncate: 14 -%}
      <b>{{ 'home.record_sold' | t: house: rec_name }}{% if p.price > 0 %} · {{ p.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% endif %}</b>
    </a>
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if shown > 0 or request.design_mode -%}
<section data-bg="#EFEAE0" data-fg="#1C1B18" style="--sec-bg:#EFEAE0;--sec-fg:#1C1B18;">
  <div class="shell pad" id="record">
    {%- assign arc = collections['archive'] -%}
    {%- if arc.handle == 'archive' and arc.products_count > 0 -%}
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.heading }}</p>
        <a class="sec-all" href="{{ arc.url }}">{{ 'home.all_pieces' | t }}</a></div>
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.heading }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="grid6">
      {{ items }}
      {%- if shown == 0 -%}{%- for i in (1..6) -%}<div class="rec"><b>—</b></div>{%- endfor -%}{%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
{% schema %}
{ "name": "The Record", "settings": [
  { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "The Archive" },
  { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Sold collection" }
], "presets": [{ "name": "The Record" }] }
{% endschema %}
